id: 22
hanzi: 消费
pinyin: xiāo fèi
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to consume; to spend; consumption; expenditure
  es: consumir; gastar; consumo; gasto; desembolso

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to spend money or deplete material resources in exchange for goods, food, or commercial services | gastar dinero o emplear recursos y víveres para adquirir bienes de consumo o servicios | 理性消费 (consume rationally / spend sensibly)
  2 | Noun | Formal | the economic activity of using up goods and services to satisfy human wants; consumer expenditure | actividad económica y social consistente en la utilización de bienes y servicios; consumo | 消费水平 (consumption level / consumer spending level)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 年轻人在网上购物时应当保持克制与理性，量入为出，切忌盲目跟风和过度消费。 | Niánqīngrén zài wǎngshàng gòuwù shí yīngdāng bǎochí kèzhì yǔ lǐxìng, liàngrù-wéichū, qièjì mángmù gēnfēng hé guòdù xiāofèi. | Young people should exercise restraint and rationality when shopping online, living within their means and avoiding blind following or overspending. | Los jóvenes deben mantener la templanza y el juicio al comprar en línea, gastando según sus ingresos y evitando modas ciegas o el consumismo desenfrenado.
  #2 | 作为拉动经济增长的三驾马车之一，持续扩大国内居民消费需求，是推动产业转型升级与经济高质量发展的强劲引擎。 | Zuòwéi lādòng jīngjì zēngzhǎng de sānjià mǎchē zhīyī, chíxù kuòdà guónèi jūmín xiāofèi xūqiú, shì tuīdòng chǎnyè zhuǎnxíng shēngjí yǔ jīngjì gāozhìliàng fāzhǎn de qiángjìn yǐnqíng. | As one of the three troikas driving economic growth, expanding domestic consumption demand is a powerful engine for industrial upgrading and high-quality development. | Como una de las tres locomotoras del crecimiento económico, fomentar la demanda interna de consumo es un motor vigoroso para la modernización productiva del país.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  刺激消费 | stimulate consumption; boost consumer spending
  消费者权益 | consumer rights and interests
