idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  量入为出 | liàng rù wéi chū | assess income to determine expenditure; live within means
  节衣缩食 | jié yī suō shí | tighten one's belt; economize on food and clothing
  挥金如土 | huī jīn rú tǔ | squander money like dirt; spend lavishly
  开源节流 | kāi yuán jié liú | tap new sources of revenue and reduce expenditures

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  消 | xiāo | vanish; disperse; consume; eliminate | desaparecer; disipar; consumir; extinguir | 氵 | water | 氵 (water washing away) | 肖 (xiāo, small / resemble) | 10 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic character where water radical 氵 indicates flowing water gradually dissolving or eroding goods away, and 肖 supplies sound. | Water (氵) flowing ceaselessly dissolves and washes away grains and resources until they diminish and disappear (消). | El agua corriente (氵) disuelve y desvanece los recursos poco a poco hasta hacerlos desaparecer por completo (消). | 55 | EFB | 
  费 | fèi | cost; spend; expense; waste | gastar; costo; gasto; honorarios | 贝 | cowrie shell / money | 贝 (shell currency, expense) | 弗 (fú, not / wind around) | 9 | 上下结构 | Simplified from 費. Ancient character combining 弗 (winding, tension) above cowrie currency 贝, depicting outbound money spent and disbursed. | Strings of valuable shell currency (贝) untied and disbursed (弗) to acquire goods constitute expense and spending (费). | Las sartas de conchas monetarias (贝) desatadas y entregadas (弗) a cambio de provisiones representan el gasto y el costo (费). | 51 | LNBO | 費

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Resources washed away and diminished like water (消) while valuable shell money is expended (费) represents commercial consumption and spending (消费).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Víveres que se desvanecen como el agua (消) mientras se desembolsan conchas monetarias (费) encarnan el consumo y el gasto (消费).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Traditional Chinese economic philosophy, exemplified in Xunzi's 'Rich Country' (荀子·富国), prioritized production and frugality over conspicuous consumption. Modern macroeconomic discourse in China has repositioned domestic consumption (内需消费) as the primary stabilizing engine of the dual-circulation model.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: High-level 1st tone followed by falling 4th tone: 'xiāo fèi' (55-51). Hold 'xiāo' high and sustained, then drop sharply with decisive stress on 'fèi'.

traps_and_cognates:
