    悄 | qiāo | quiet; silent | Contains heart radical 忄 on the left instead of water 氵
    梢 | shāo | tip of branch; treetop | Contains wood radical 木 on the left instead of water 氵
    捎 | shāo | bring along; carry casually | Contains hand radical 扌 on the left instead of water 氵
    沸 | fèi | boil; bubble over | Contains water radical 氵 before 弗 instead of shell 贝 below
    拂 | fú | brush off; sweep lightly | Contains hand radical 扌 before 弗 instead of shell 贝 below
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    消 | xiāo | vanish; dissolve; disperse; spend
    销 | xiāo | melt; cancel; market; sell
    费 | fèi | spend; expense; fee; consume
    资 | zī | money; capital; resources; endow
    财 | cái | wealth; money; valuables

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 消费 denotes the ongoing purchase and consumption of goods, products, and services to satisfy living needs.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 消费 vs. 花费 | huāfèi | 消费 is an economic and sociological concept of consumer expenditure, while 花费 is an everyday term referring to specific money, time, or energy spent.
    2 | 消费 vs. 浪费 | làngfèi | 消费 is standard, legitimate expenditure for life's needs, whereas 浪费 carries a negative moral judgment meaning to squander or misuse resources needlessly.
    3 | 消费 vs. 投资 | tóuzī | 消费 depletes capital to satisfy current consumption, while 投资 deploys capital into assets with the expectation of generating future economic returns.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 走在流光溢彩的商业街区，琳琅满目的橱窗让人目不暇接。面对形形色色的打折促销，理性的消费者懂得按需选购，不为华丽的宣传所诱惑，让每一分消费都物有所值。 | Zǒu zài liúguāng-yìcǎi de shāngyè jiēqū, línláng-mǎnmù de chúchuāng ràng rén mùbùxiájiē. Miànduì xíngxíng-sèsè de dǎzhé cùxiāo, lǐxìng de xiāofèizhě dǒngde ànxū xuǎngòu, bù wèi huálì de xuānchuán suǒ yòuhuò, ràng měi yì fēn xiāofèi dōu wùyǒusuǒzhí. | Walking through gleaming commercial avenues, eye-catching shop displays dazzle pedestrians. Facing diverse discounts, sensible consumers buy only what they need, ensuring every penny spent delivers true value. | Al pasear por las avenidas comerciales, los escaparates luminosos cautivan la vista. Ante las múltiples rebajas, el comprador juicioso adquiere solo lo preciso, haciendo que cada desembolso valga la pena.
  #2 | 在数字经济时代，移动支付与线上平台的飞速普及极大地重构了大众的消费模式。从有形商品的采购到文化旅游等服务体验，消费结构的持续升级折射出当代人对美好生活的热切追求。 | Zài shùzì jīngjì shídài, yídòng zhīfù yǔ xiànshàng píngtái de fēisù pǔjí jídà de chónggòu le dàzhòng de xiāofèi móshì. Cóng yǒuxíng shāngpǐn de cǎigòu dào wénhuà lǚyóu děng fúwù tǐyàn, xiāofèi jiégòu de chíxù shēngjí zhéshè chū dāngdàirén duì měihǎo shēnghuó de rèqiè zhuīqiú. | In the digital era, mobile payments and online platforms have reshaped consumer patterns. From tangible goods to travel services, the upgrade in consumption reflects people's pursuit of a quality life. | En la era digital, los pagos móviles han remodelado el consumo popular. Desde mercancías tangibles hasta experiencias culturales, el auge del consumo refleja la aspiración contemporánea al bienestar.
